  {
   "id": "cap-bpl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -2370,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "routed experts 128×30 **22.84B** (88.4%) · sliding attention ×25 **865.1M** (3.3%) · global attention ×5 **245.1M** (0.9%) · dense MLP ×30 (always on) **535.3M** (2.1%) · embed **738.2M** (2.9%) · vision tower + projector **572.8M** (2.2%) · lm head **0** (tied: same table as embed) · self-conditioning MLP **17.8M** (<0.1%) · router ×30 **10.9M** (<0.1%) · norms + layer scalars **0.6M** (<0.1%) · encoder layer scalars **30** (<0.1%)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bct",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -2266,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 40,
