  {
   "id": "cap-bcl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -2170,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "routed experts 128×30 **1.43B** (37.2%) · sliding attention ×25 **865.1M** (22.5%) · global attention ×5 **245.1M** (6.4%) · dense MLP ×30 (always on) **535.3M** (13.9%) · lm head **738.2M** (19.2%) · embed **0** (row lookup) · vision tower + projector **0** (runs per image) · self-conditioning MLP **17.8M** (0.5%) · router ×30 **10.9M** (0.3%) · norms + layer scalars **0.6M** (<0.1%) · encoder layer scalars **0** (prompt pass only)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -2060,
   "width": 1260,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "# DiffusionGemma 26B-A4B — model  \nA **block-diffusion** LM built on Gemma 4 26B-A4B. Text comes out in **canvases of 256 tokens**: a canvas starts as random token ids and is denoised by up to 48 full forward passes, each predicting all 256 positions at once. Grey bars = tensors (0.08 px/channel), boxes = operations. *Layer* tab = one layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": -2060,
   "width": 1260,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "**One set of 30 layers, two passes.** The *encoder* pass runs them **causally** over the prompt (and over each finished canvas) once, only to fill the KV cache. The *decoder* pass runs the same weights **bidirectionally** over the canvas, reading that cache.    \nRow colours — **grey**: sliding window 1024, 16 q / 8 kv heads × 256 · **cyan**: global, 16 q / 2 kv heads × 512, K = V. Every layer: dense MLP + MoE 8 of 128 in parallel."
  },
  {
   "id": "canvas",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -230,
   "y": -1760,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**canvas** — 256 positions after the cached prefix    \nstep 1: uniform random ids from the whole vocab (no mask token)",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "ids1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -20,
   "y": -1630,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 170,
   "y": -1642,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`canvas ids [256]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "embed3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": -1581,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**embed** — row lookup × √2816  \n738.2M · 262,144 × 2816",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "x4",
   "type": "text",
