  },
  {
   "id": "sc6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -230,
   "y": -1436,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 116,
   "text": "**self-conditioning** — soft embedding of the previous step's logits (softmax · table × √d; zeros at step 1) → RMSNorm → gated MLP 2816→2112→2816, **+ x** → RMSNorm  \n17.8M",
   "color": "#22c55e"
  },
  {
